# Build context for the Go services.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the repository-wide file,
# which is how two images with different needs stop sharing one exclusion list.
# A Go service copies cmd/, internal/ and proto/ and nothing else, so every
# other directory here is bytes sent to the daemon for no reason -- web/ alone
# is the larger half of this repository.
.git
.github
.claude
web/
docs/
task/
legacy/
tools/
deploy/observability/
examples/

bin/
dist/
tmp/
temp/
logs/
runtime/
*.log
*.out
*.test
*.prof
coverage.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
.env
go.work
go.work.sum
